otengine/godot/pull/107762.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107762.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Closes [#9742](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9742).\r\nAllows comments starting with `#mark` and `#region` to be visible as text in the Script Editor's Minimap.\r\n\r\n![minimap](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e9fc6d23-99c1-4f6e-b320-a5dc67b43a33)\r\n\r\nDraft progress:\r\n- [x] `#mark Description` support\r\n- [x] `#region Description` support\r\n- [x] Increased line height\r\n- [x] Respect indentation\r\n- [x] Accurate visible area rectangle\r\n- [x] Minimap overflow\r\n- [x] Script editor overflow\r\n- [x] Accurate culling\r\n- [x] Accurate viewport offset\r\n- [x] Accurate hovering and dragging\r\n- [ ] Unique syntax highlighting for `#mark`, managed via Editor setting\r\n- [ ] Override color with comment marker colors (Critical, Warning, Notice)\r\n\r\nCloses #113215 as a result of most recent task completions.\r\n\r\nTrying to commit to as few files as possible until I work through this. Any feedback is welcome.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107762/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107762/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}